 13→ *
 14→ * Flow per exercise:
 15→ *   API: create exercise (practice_mode) → join waiting room → start engine → begin
 16→ *   UI: for each of 15 decisions: read role cards → select options → submit per card
 17→ *   API: stop exercise (cleanup)
 18→ *
 19→ * Decision flow:
 20→ *   The decision_sequence maps 1:1 to evt-t1 through evt-t15.
 21→ *   Each event opens one decision with target_roles specifying which role cards appear.
 22→ *   Advisor role cards submit recommendations first, then the CO (decision_maker) submits
 23→ *   the binding decision which closes the turn and auto-triggers the next via
