 28→ *   - Advisor cards (nav, pwo, eo, cyop, aawo, ops) show checkboxes and a Submit button
 29→ *   - CO card (decision_maker) shows checkboxes, advisor recs, and a Submit button
 30→ *   - Cards with status "intel" show no checkboxes (role not targeted by decision)
